      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GERALDTON CREW (4) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by 1.3 lengths at Traralgon in a handy 24.45 beating Storm Coming. Was a winner at his only start from this draw. Looks the testing material. HEART (6) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing seventh (22.78) last time in a Grade 5 at Ballarat. Form at the trip sound including three wins. Has ability and is one of the better chances. PAW AMARLI (2) finished fifth last time at this track but could not have been more impressive before that in her sharp 22.66 win at Geelong over 400m. Top win two back and can measure up again. PAW XYLA (8) is likely to have admirers.",
